 ## Checks
 
-`bun run typecheck`, `bun run lint`, `bun run format:check`, `bun run test`, `bun run build`.
+`bun run verify:fast` runs formatting, lint, the disable-directive scan, typecheck and tests (with
+coverage and CRAP gates). `bun run verify:full` adds Knip and the build. `bun run test:mutation:domain`
+runs Stryker on the pure `src/lib` helpers. In CI, also run `bun run lint:suppressions <merge-base>`
+so no file's `eslint-suppressions.json` count can grow; shrink it only with
+`eslint --prune-suppressions`.
 Tests run against a fresh temp SQLite database per test (`src/test/helpers.ts`).
 
 ## Layout
